eld by Orchid (reports 4w/2w old). My forces are largely at camp or stale. Kite/Tiger status unknown. I must probe. Sending cavalry to N-West to catch riders or spot Kite movements near N-Village/Village. Holding others to preserve strength for counter-attack if F1"},{"seq":566,"t":3900,"type":"courier","id":"c191","house":"rhino","letter":"L241","kind":"order","to":"rhino-cav-1","path":["rhino-camp","north-village","n-mid"],"depart":4200,"plain":"HORSE, MARCH TO NORTH BANK WEST.","cipher":"DKQRA, IMQND TK JKQTD OMJG WART."},{"seq":567,"t":3900,"type":"model","house":"kite","model":"nim:nvidia/nemotron-3-ultra-550b-a55b","tokens":4697,"retries":1,"error":"no JSON object found"},{"seq":568,"t":3900,"type":"orders_lost","house":"kite","why":"no JSON object found"},{"seq":569,"t":3900,"type":"model","house":"orchid","model":"local:local","tokens":1583,"retries":0},{"seq":570,"t":3900,"type":"thought","house":"orchid","text":"Rhino is pressing at F2 and F1. My infantry is at F1 and S-Mid. I need to consolidate and press the advantage. Rhino has forces at F1, F2, and N-West. I will move my archers to F1 to support the infantry there."},{"seq":571,"t":3900,"type":"courier","id":"c192","house":"orchid","letter":"L242","kind":"order","to":"orchid-arch-1","path":["orchid-camp","s-west","F1","n-west"],"depart":3900,"plain":"BOWMEN, MARCH TO WEST FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":572,"t":3900,"type":"model","house":"tiger","model":"local:local","tokens":1572,"retries":0},{"seq":573,"t":3900,"type":"thought","house":"tiger","text":"My forces are at F3 (East Ford) and S-East. Rhino is at N-East, threatening F3. I should reinforce F3 and secure my current position, adhering to the 'hold' doctrine."},{"seq":574,"t":3900,"type":"courier","id":"c193","house":"tiger","letter":"L243","kind":"order","to":"tiger-inf-1","path":["tiger-camp","s-east","F3"],"depart":3900,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, HOLD AT EAST FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":575,"t":3900,"type":"courier","id":"c194","house":"tiger","let